# Two-circuit build (SCHILD_PROFILE=private): the full daemon bodies live in
# private/root_task/ and are OVERLAID over the stubs in tools/sel4/src by
# tools/sel4/build_rt.sh. They are intentionally COMMITTED (tracked) — the
# private profile reads them from <repo>/private/root_task/, never from src/.
# (No other private/ overlay exists; there is no distributed-ledger tree here.)

